    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "about $700 billion last year across every deal in \nevery country on the planet. So, the claim is that  "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1126800,
    "dDurationMs": 4400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "roughly a fifth of the annual global total \nhas already been quietly committed to Iran,  "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1131200,
    "dDurationMs": 4800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and nobody thought to write it down or put a \nname on it. The one and only potential source  "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1136000,
    "dDurationMs": 3840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that even makes a little bit of sense is that \nthe sovereign wealth funds of the Gulf States may  "
